// From mp_sector_terrain_north_tunnel_rocks.map, brush 1 — the COLLISION
// twin of the visual mesh in patch_rock_visual.mapfrag.
//
// Key differences from the visual mesh:
//   - `contents weaponClip detail ai_nosight;` line is present.
//       weaponClip = bullets stop on it
//       detail     = doesn't contribute to BSP cuts
//       ai_nosight = AI cannot see THROUGH it (so zombies path to
//                    the player, not around the rock)
//   - Different render material (a "blend" variant for terrain blending)
//   - Optional per-vertex color `c R G B A` on some control points
//     (used for blend weights)
//   - Optional `decalLayerSort` / `decalEditorSort` for decal sorting
//
// Control point COORDINATES are identical to the visual mesh — both
// must occupy the exact same volume.
